items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Heartwinder_Plaque_Antechamber.name=Notice at the Winding Chamber
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Heartwinder_Plaque_Antechamber.description=WINDING CHAMBER. The overseer winds the hearts at the turn of every hour. Do not enter while it winds. In case of overwind, turn all four brake valves at once. Do not let it reach midnight.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Heartwinder_Plaque_Vault.name=Winding Log, Final Entry
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Heartwinder_Plaque_Vault.description=Hearts wound: all of them. Masters returned: none. The spring is tired and so am I. If you are reading this, the winding is finished. Take the hearts up into the light. Let them rest.
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Heartwinder_Tick.name=Winding Chamber Tick
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Heartwinder_Pylon.name=Winding Chamber Pylon
items.Machinaria_Heartworks_Heartwinder_Pylon.description=A steam pylon with a gauge of four lamps. Each turn lights one more.

